  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Vinod Sekhar is a Malaysian industrialist and founder of Petra Group and Green Rubber. His rubber recycling business commercialised technology developed by his father, scientist B. C. Sekhar. Based in Kuala Lumpur, he has built businesses spanning industrial technology, construction and media, while establishing a foundation that supports healthcare and education.",
    "html": "<p>Vinod Sekhar is a Malaysian industrialist and founder of Petra Group and Green Rubber. His rubber recycling business commercialised technology developed by his father, scientist B. C. Sekhar. Based in Kuala Lumpur, he has built businesses spanning industrial technology, construction and media, while establishing a foundation that supports healthcare and education.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
